Can you find me on irc/jabber so we can dissect the core file?  That line 
is looping through the dispatcher:

    for (list<Dispatcher*>::iterator p = dispatchers.begin();
	 p != dispatchers.end();
	 p++)
      if ((*p)->ms_dispatch(m))
	return;

It probably means we aren't shutting things down in the right order.

